+
+## Enhanced mist
+
+`rtx.atmosphere.numos.volumetrics` defaults to 0, which pauses Remix's froxel passes. Value 1 hands off from
+the player's Remix fog to NUMOS air at the camera froxel range. Value 2 restores the original exclusive
+selection by `rtx.volumetrics.enable`. The device reads the player's setting at frame begin and resets
+fog histories across a policy change. VR uses the Standard sky policy.
