+++ b/docs/fork-touchpoints.md
@@ -4171,3 +4171,11 @@ The host adapter lives in `rtx_numos*.cpp/.h`. [Enhanced sky options](RemixNumos
 The NUMOS post-depth hook in `rtx_numos.cpp` runs `rtx_fork_numos_rays`. Only the Enhanced composite binds its
 two extra slots and applies the filled ray image to a true camera miss. `src/dxvk/meson.build` lists the pass
 and `test_enhanced_sky.cpp` checks the option names, skip policy and quality selection.
+
+## Enhanced mist policy (2026-11-26)
+
+`rtx_global_volumetrics.*` latches the device policy and resets resources and histories. `rtx_context.cpp`
+skips paused froxel dispatch. `rtx_numos.cpp` passes the effective world-space range to NUMOS.
+`volume_args.h` reserves enable tag 2. The host `volume_lighting.slangh` clips segments before calling the
+pinned RTXDI routine. The Enhanced composite orders near in-scatter in front of the far air and clouds.
+The base composite compiles the original attenuation routine.
